Commit:     Fabricio Breve <fbreve@gmail.com>
CommitDate: Wed Oct 21 11:00:37 2026 -0300

    Preserve lightgun state across savestates
    
    Freeze lightgun temporal state during savestate transport and preserve the state required for deterministic lightgun replay.
    
    Extend the tagged savestate format to version 8 with a validated 46-bit lightgun snapshot and restore TH direction coherently with the captured controller state.
    
    Prevent savestate transport from arming false lightgun sensor events while preserving correct post-restore beam, HCounter, and controller behavior.
    
    Add accepted-boundary, save-only, timing-window, transport-stall, external input, and controller regression coverage.

